==Russian==

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ru|orv|судьно}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*sǫdьno}}. Cognates include [[сосуд]], [[посуда]], [[судок]]. Ultimately from {{m|ine-pro|*som-}} + {{m|ine-pro|*dʰeh₁-}} + {{m|ine-pro|*-os}}.

The nautical meaning is a late calque from {{m+|fr|vaisseau}}.

